      "source_text": "Step 1. With $T=4$, the coefficient $2W/T=1$ gives $h(x)=x-\\operatorname{ReLU}(2x)$. It equals $x$ on $x\\le0$ and $-x$ on $x\\ge0$, or $-|x|$.",
