      "source_text": "Step 3. With $T=2$, $h(x)=x-2\\operatorname{ReLU}(2x)$ has slopes $1$ and $-3$. Its Lipschitz constant is $3$. Invertibility and positivity of $T$ alone are insufficient; $T\\ge W^\\top W$ matters.",
