      "source_text": "Step 1. $U=2\\sqrt2/5$ and $Y=6\\sqrt2/5$. Thus $Y\\operatorname{ReLU}(Ux)=(24/25)\\operatorname{ReLU}(x)$, with exact gain $24/25=0.96$.",
